# Find The Needle, French.
#
# An empty msgstr is not a bug: it means the string falls back to its message
# id, which is the English source text. See docs/localization/PLAN.md.
#
# French has two plural forms, and unlike English it counts zero and one
# together as the singular: msgstr[0] for 0 and 1, msgstr[1] for 2 and up.
#
# To bring this file up to date after the English has moved:
#     python scripts/dev/gen_pot.py --merge fr
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Find The Needle\n"
"Language: fr\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

msgid "SMALL"
msgstr "PETIT"

msgid "Designed for weaker computers. A shorter hunt with room to walk around the pile."
msgstr "Conçu pour les ordinateurs moins puissants. Une chasse plus courte, avec de la place pour faire le tour du tas."

msgid "STANDARD"
msgstr "STANDARD"

msgid "The yard as it comes. The pile the game was built around, under one steel roof."
msgstr "La cour telle qu'elle est. Le tas autour duquel le jeu a été pensé, sous un seul toit en acier."

msgid "BIG"
msgstr "GRAND"

msgid "Twice the hay and a crown that stands over the wall plates. Bring a belt."
msgstr "Deux fois plus de foin, et un sommet qui dépasse le haut des murs. Prévois un tapis."

msgid "HUGE"
msgstr "ÉNORME"

msgid "Eight storeys of straw. The shed goes out to meet it and the roof still loses. Slow to load."
msgstr "Huit étages de paille. Le hangar s'agrandit pour l'accueillir et le toit perd quand même. Long à charger."

msgid "THE MOUNTAIN"
msgstr "LA MONTAGNE"

msgid "Fifty metres. It does not fit under the roof, it is not supposed to, and you will not finish it. Takes a minute to pour."
msgstr "Cinquante mètres. Elle ne tient pas sous le toit, ce n'est pas prévu, et tu n'en viendras pas à bout. Il faut une minute pour la déverser."

